# The images copy the build context with `COPY . .`. Only the Cargo workspace and the
# benchmark payloads go in; everything else in the checkout stays out, whatever it is.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!benchmark/
!dactie-*/
!ps16/
!thressig/
# BENCH_PAYLOAD_FILE=/usr/src/dactie/<file> reads the payload inside the image
# (scripts/latency_sweep.sh)
!misp/
!stix/

# Key material and node state, also inside the crates if a node was run from there.
**/key_material
**/key_material.json
**/storage.json
**/slots.json*
**/group_saves
**/.*.tmp

# Env files such as one holding ARCHIVE_DB_PASSWORD, and local build output.
**/.env
**/*.env
**/target
**/*.swp
